{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>亞太經合組織（APEC）峰會一連兩日（18日至19日）在深圳舉行，國家主席習近平、俄羅斯總統普京及美國總統特朗普今午（19日）將舉行三方會談，預計歷時約一小時。俄羅斯總統助理烏沙科夫（Yuri Ushakov）表示，會談實際會進行多久，將由三國元首自行決定，預料會談將聚焦於重大國際衝突。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:23:57.771766+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T01:32:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T16:54:38.602393+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T02:17:33.421223+00:00","content_hash":"3688d79a79661276bcb9c82e76bca3b640875e769e4b68f45aafaa6b8ffaf132","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}